  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan receives a Zombie Alliance token, he also receives a set of information path mortal Gu used to transmit task information, news of new members or members leaving, and important notices such as a member’s death.",
      "chapters": [
        743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_zombie_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same toolkit later lets him send and receive all sorts of information to and from Zombie Alliance without travelling to the headquarters for every mission update.",
      "chapters": [
        906
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Holding an information path mortal Gu, Fang Yuan shuts his eyes and views from Fairy Li Shan’s perspective, watching a rank eight battle as if he were present in Snowy Mountain blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        814
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recorded-scenes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_li_shan",
        "loc_snowy_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xiao clan’s transaction token comes with preferential policies whose details are recorded in an information path mortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        908
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trade-and-inheritance-records",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_xiao_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A rank five information path mortal Gu can hold the details of Hei Fan’s true inheritance, including an introduction to the Gu worms inside it.",
      "chapters": [
        1129
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trade-and-inheritance-records",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_hei_fan_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mortal rank stock in general is covered on Mortal Gu. Gu as living tools are covered on Gu worms. Formation path stock of the same mortal band is covered on Formation Path Mortal Gu.",
